"Each entity gets a LIMITED number of free-actions per round that skip the action queue and resolve immediately, outside the normal action system. First members: taking items (EXCEPT items flagged valuable, a future flag that forces the queued path) and emoting. Related: the recorded mergeable-actions task offers instantaneous-outside-the-queue as its simpler alternative for take/equip/unequip -- free actions are that idea made a budgeted mechanic."